{
  "root_cause": "The dialog retains aria-modal='true' when hidden, causing the focus trap listener (maintainFocus) to return focus to the dialog after attempting to restore focus to the opener.",
  "repair_strategy": "In the hide method, remove the aria-modal attribute (or set to false) before restoring focus, ensuring the dialog is no longer considered modal when the focus trap listener runs.",
  "edits": [
    {
