  "expected_accessibility_effect": "After closing the dialog with Escape, focus returns to the button that opened the dialog, meeting keyboard focus order expectations.",
  "functional_risks": [
    "Removing aria-modal may affect assistive technology perception of dialog modality while hidden; however, aria-modal should only be present when dialog is shown. Risk low.",
